{"_data": [{"contents": [{"type": "lesson_name", "content": ""}, {"type": "unit_name", "content": "Processes Involved in a Business"}, {"type": "position", "content": 10}, {"type": "origin", "content": "stub"}, {"type": "lesson", "content": 1}, {"type": "level", "content": "A1.1"}], "type": "metadata"}, {"contents": [{"type": "test", "content": "false"}], "type": "achievment_test"}, {"contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "These are words you hear when you talk about business processes."}], "type": "target_word_describer"}, {"contents": [{"type": "primary", "content": "Understands systems theories, business processes and basic concepts on IT.   Create a map of processes that allows identifying areas in an information system, using IT tools to generate reports based on the company's needs."}, {"type": "secondary_1", "content": "Understands simple information in slow conversations about the communicative topics and vocabulary related to this level."}, {"type": "secondary_2", "content": "Exchanges simple information on IT concepts, systems theory, and diagrams of processes."}], "type": "objectives"}, {"type": "background_image", "content": "enpe8n1le01ob10re1img01.jpg"}, {"contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Sequence Words for Basic Instructions"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "You use linking words to connect ideas and give basic instructions. Every time you want to guide a person or a group of people through giving them advice, it is useful to use basic instruction words."}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":3,\"columns\":4,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<strong>Basic Sequence Words:</strong>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<div class=\\\"center_text\\\"> First \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Second  \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Next \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Thereafter\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<div class=\\\"center_text\\\">Then\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"After this/that\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Finally\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Subsequently\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}"}, {"type": "text", "content": "For example:   <br /><br />      <span class=\"italic\"><span class=\"strong\">First,</span> keep in mind the initial client meeting. </span> <br />   <span class=\"italic\"><span class=\"strong\"> After this,</span> contact headquarters. </span>  <br /> <br />    Every time you're giving basic instructions, use the infinitive form of the verb <span class=\"strong\">without \u201cto\u201d</span> after linking words:   <br /><br />  -\t<span class=\"italic\"><strong>Second</strong>, check the transportation vehicles. </span>  <br />   -\t<span class=\"italic\">Second, <strike>to check</strike> the transportation vehicles. </span>  <br /><br />      -\t<span class=\"italic\"><strong>Finally</strong>, state a new procedure. </span> <br />     -\t<span class=\"italic\">Finally, <strike>to state</strike> a new procedure.</span>  <br /><br />      Remember that if you want to indicate what not to do, you use <span class=\"strong\">do not - don't</span> after linking words.   <br /><br />    -\t<span class=\"italic\"><strong>Thereafter, do not forget</strong> the redesign process. </span> <br />     -\t<span class=\"italic\">Thereafter, <strike>not forget</strike> the redesign process. </span>  <br /><br />      -\t<span class=\"italic\">First, do not avoid the function of information systems. </span><br />    -\t<span class=\"italic\">First, <strike>not avoid</strike> the function of information systems. </span>"}, {"type": "example", "content": "First, I need to perform an analysis. Second, identify the requirements and then design a plan."}, {"type": "example", "content": "Next, start the design to establish some strategies."}, {"type": "example", "content": "Finally, the implementation process, the designed plan put into practice."}, {"type": "example", "content": "Thereafter, use that information to identify the present state of the business, which is the 'As-Is' process."}, {"type": "example", "content": "After the analysis process, check the requirements."}, {"type": "example", "content": "That's correct! I did it earlier.  "}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Processes Involved in Business"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "A business process is a group of serial activities that determine the steps to achieve a goal.  <br /> You can create a <strong>business process</strong> according to the market requirements by considering two stages: the Present and the Future, also called the As-Is process and the To-Be process, respectively.<br /> <br />  "}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":4,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<div class=\\\"center_text\\\">An As-Is process\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<div class=\\\"center_text\\\">A To-Be process\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" <div class=\\\"center_text\\\"><span class=\\\"strong\\\">Current state process\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<div class=\\\"center_text\\\"> <span class=\\\"strong\\\">Future state process\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<div class=\\\"center_text\\\">&#8595; \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<div class=\\\"center_text\\\">&#8595; \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"existing state of a business\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"upcoming state of a business\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}"}, {"type": "text", "content": "Information systems represent business processes through a life cycle that starts from the analysis and finishes with an implementation to finally reach a goal. Those stages are the following:   <br /><br />  <div class=\"center_text\"><span class=\"strong\">Goal-Directed Activities</span></div>  <br />  <div class=\"center_text\"><span class=\"strong\">Analysis: </span> Double-checking the present situation with the customer and some other variables. </div>  <br />   <div class=\"center_text\"><span class=\"strong\">Requirements: </span>The condition stated by a customer to achieve the goals or established condition to enhance a process; To-be business stage. </div>  <br />  <div class=\"center_text\"><span class=\"strong\">Design: </span>Establishing a plan, specifying strategies during the process, and including the funding process. </div> <br />  <div class=\"center_text\"><span class=\"strong\">Development: </span> Conducting consecutive actions to successfully complete the process. </div>  <br />  <div class=\"center_text\"><span class=\"strong\">Implementation: </span> Putting the designed plan into practice. </div>  <br />   Information systems transform any process to make it more efficient, that is why information systems represent an effective model to fulfill business processes' requirements."}, {"type": "image", "content": "enpe8n1le01ob10img01.jpg"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "outsourcing"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a business practice to hire external suppliers and assign them part of the company work"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun) "}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Thereafter, the development process takes place to register variables such as metrics, milestones, and outsourcing process. "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "enpe8n1le01ob10aud01"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "sequential"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "occurring after something else, in a sequence"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: It consists of some sequential steps that rely on the business' requirements."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "enpe8n1le01ob10aud02"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "metric"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "related to the measurement of different values, a metric system"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun) "}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Thereafter, the development process takes place to register variables such as metrics, milestones, and outsourcing process."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "enpe8n1le01ob10aud03"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "inventory"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a list of items such as property, goods, or contents"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun) "}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: This also includes making the inventory of physical and financial assets.  "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "enpe8n1le01ob10aud04"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "funding process "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "steps to get investors"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun) "}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Consider the funding process; this will help you if you get out of cash!"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "enpe8n1le01ob10aud05"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "financial asset "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "representation of monetary value"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: This also includes making the inventory of physical and financial assets. "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "enpe8n1le01ob10aud06"}], "type": "ta