Samuel</strong>: Ivan, I need your business plan on the 3rd of April. </br>\n<strong>Ivan</strong>: Do you need it in the morning? </br>\n<strong>Samuel</strong>: Sure. I need it on my desk at 8:00 a. m. Do you already have a draft of it? </br>\nI<strong>van</strong>: Yes, Samuel. It consists of some sequential steps that rely on the business' requirements. </br>\n<strong>Samuel</strong>: Good! Having a business plan at the very beginning of the project is important. </br>\n<strong>Ivan</strong>: Yes! First, I need to perform analysis; second, identify the requirements; and then, design a plan. </br>\n<strong>Samuel</strong>: That is a long process! Do not forget you also need to make a product development process and complete the implementation process on time to achieve the business goal. </br>\n<strong>Ivan</strong>: Of course! That is my concern because we need to do everything on time and apply the plan strategies."}, {"time": "50500", "image": "enpe8n1le01ob10re2img02.jpg", "id": 1, "text": "<strong>Samuel</strong>: So, can you briefly describe each process? </br>\n<strong>Ivan</strong>: Sure. First, perform analysis to implement an accounting book to keep a record of the money you spent in businesses; this also includes making the inventory of physical and financial assets. Thereafter, use that information to identify the present state of the business; this is the \"As-Is process.\" </br>\n<strong>Samuel</strong>: That's correct! I did it before."}, {"time": "78500", "image": "enpe8n1le01ob10re2img03.jpg", "id": 2, "text": "<strong>Ivan</strong>: After the analysis process, you check the requirements, which are the initial customer needs. Then, start the design to establish strategies, and at the same time, consider the funding process; this will help you if you get out of cash! </br>\n<strong>Samuel</strong>: Do not forget the minimum that you need is to implement one process at a time. </br>\n<strong>Ivan</strong>: That's pretty important! Thereafter, the development process takes place to register variables such as metrics, milestones, and outsourcing process. Finally, the implementation process puts the designed plan into practice; this process can include computer technology in the business. </br>\n<strong>Samuel</strong>: And why is it relevant? </br>\n<strong>Ivan</strong>: Business processes help entrepreneurs achieve goals in a more effective and innovative way, creating a high company value."}], "coverimg": "enpe8n1le01ob10re2img01.jpg"}, "type": "slideshow"}], "type": "audio", "_data": [], "id": 1, "title": ""}], "id": 0, "_data": [{"contents": [{"type": "has_nav", "content": true}, {"type": "has_exercise_controls", "content": true}], "type": "lab_options"}], "type": "scholar"}]}